player: [controller] input -> intention -> affect
boss: [controller] instruction -> intention -> affect

controller: place where "first", expected behvaiour 
intention: place where behavior changes depending on interaction (parry)
affect: place where stats consequences of behaviour (damage)


intentions (Boss, Player):
if Player hit boss hitbox 
{
	Player parry
	Boss parry
}

else
{
	Do what they want to do
}
